msgid "BYD 67ms multi-target slot table. 0 = off (b7-only). 1 = display: multi-target points feed the UI/telemetry only. 2 = control: quality-gated slot points may become lead candidates. Applies at the next card restart."
msgstr "BYD 67ms 多目标槽位表。0 = 关闭（仅 b7 上报）。1 = 显示：多目标点仅用于界面/遥测展示。2 = 控制：通过质量门限的槽位点可成为前车候选。下次 card 重启后生效。"

