msgid "BYD Forward Gap Gate"
msgstr "BYD 前向时距门控"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/developer.py
msgid "BYD Radar Distance Scale"
msgstr "BYD 雷达距离标定"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/developer.py
msgid "BYD Radar Slot Table"
msgstr "BYD 雷达槽位表"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/developer.py
msgid "BYD forward-gap lane-change gate. 0 = off (factory behavior). 1 = a closing forward gap blocks a lane-change start. 2 = also abort a started change when a NEW target closes in. 3 = lane-aware: adjacent-lane closings are telemetry only (own-lane closings keep the level-2 behavior; without lateral data everything stays at level 2). Applies on next card restart."
msgstr "BYD 前向车距变道门限。0 = 关闭（原厂行为）。1 = 前向车距收窄时阻止发起变道。2 = 变道过程中出现新目标收窄时同时中止变道。3 = 车道感知：邻车道收窄仅作遥测（本车道收窄保持 2 级行为；无侧向数据时全部保持 2 级）。下次 card 重启后生效。"

